  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>label-point-search · 1×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 64 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-label-point-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-label-point-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAABlBMVEVfZnLZ2dmiVvOOAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAJ0ADkXbPd0AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const ringOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; ringOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const featureOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; featureOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const polygonOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; polygonOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const pointsOutOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; pointsOut: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const distancesOutOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; distancesOut: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const degenerateOutOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"18\">@group(0) @binding(6) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; degenerateOut: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 550u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const RING_COUNT: u32 = 51u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const POLYGON_COUNT: u32 = 51u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">const FEATURE_COUNT: u32 = 51u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">const INITIAL_GRID_SIZE: u32 = 16u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">const REFINEMENT_GRID_SIZE: u32 = 8u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">const REFINEMENT_ROUNDS: u32 = 6u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">const CANDIDATE_COUNT: u32 = 4u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">const SMALL_FEATURE_VERTEX_LIMIT: u32 = 32u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">const WORKGROUP_SIZE: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">const LARGE: f32 = 3.0e38;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">fn getRingRowStart(ring: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  return min(ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + ring], ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">fn getRingRowEnd(ring: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  return min(ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + ring + 1u], ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">fn getSegmentDistanceSquared(p: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let edge = b - a;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  let lengthSquared = dot(edge, edge);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  var t = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  if (lengthSquared &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    t = clamp(dot(p - a, edge) / lengthSquared, 0.0, 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let offset = p - (a + t * edge);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  return dot(offset, offset);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">// Signed distance to the boundary of all rings: positive inside under the even-odd rule.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">fn getSignedDistance(p: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, ringStart: u32, ringEnd: u32, origin: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  var minimumSquared = LARGE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  var inside = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  for (var ring = ringStart; ring &lt; ringEnd; ring++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    let rowStart = getRingRowStart(ring);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    let rowEnd = getRingRowEnd(ring);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">    if (rowEnd &gt; rowStart) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">      var previous = getPosition(rowEnd - 1u) - origin;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">      for (var row = rowStart; row &lt; rowEnd; row++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">        let current = getPosition(row) - origin;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">        minimumSquared = min(minimumSquared, getSegmentDistanceSquared(p, previous, current));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">        // f32 sampling test: it only places the candidate label point; topology uses utils/exact-geometry-wgsl.ts.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">        if ((current.y &gt; p.y) != (previous.y &gt; p.y)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">          let crossingX = previous.x + (p.y - previous.y) * (current.x - previous.x) / (current.y - previous.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">          if (p.x &lt; crossingX) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">            inside = !inside;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">          }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">        previous = current;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  let distance = sqrt(minimumSquared);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  return select(-distance, distance, inside);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">// Bounds (minimum.xy, maximum.xy) relative to origin of ring &#39;ring&#39;.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">fn getRingBounds(ring: u32, origin: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec4&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  let rowStart = getRingRowStart(ring);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  let rowEnd = getRingRowEnd(ring);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  var minimum = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(LARGE);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  var maximum = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(-LARGE);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  for (var row = rowStart; row &lt; rowEnd; row++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">    let p = getPosition(row) - origin;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">    minimum = min(minimum, p);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">    maximum = max(maximum, p);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  return vec4&lt;f32&gt;(minimum, maximum);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">// Bounds of the ring with the largest extent (first on ties), used only when the feature-wide\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">// scanlines found no interior seed.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">fn getLargestRingBounds(ringStart: u32, ringEnd: u32, origin: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec4&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  var largest = vec4&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  var largestExtent = -LARGE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  for (var ring = ringStart; ring &lt; ringEnd; ring++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">    let bounds = getRingBounds(ring, origin);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">    let extent = max(bounds.z - bounds.x, bounds.w - bounds.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">    if (extent &gt; largestExtent) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">      largestExtent = extent;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">      largest = bounds;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  return largest;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">// Midpoint of the leftmost interior interval on the horizontal line y = lineY (relative to the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">// bounds center). f32 sampling code like getSignedDistance (see utils/exact-geometry-wgsl.ts for topology). Returns (x, y, 1) or z = 0 when there is none.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">fn getScanlineSeed(ringStart: u32, ringEnd: u32, origin: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, lineY: f32) -&gt; vec3&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  var firstX = LARGE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">  var firstCount = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  for (var scanPass = 0u; scanPass &lt; 2u; scanPass++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">    var secondX = LARGE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">    for (var ring = ringStart; ring &lt; ringEnd; ring++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">      let rowStart = getRingRowStart(ring);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">      let rowEnd = getRingRowEnd(ring);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">      if (rowEnd &gt; rowStart) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">        var previous = getPosition(rowEnd - 1u) - origin;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">        for (var row = rowStart; row &lt; rowEnd; row++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">          let current = getPosition(row) - origin;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">          if ((current.y &gt; lineY) != (previous.y &gt; lineY)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">            let crossingX = previous.x + (lineY - previous.y) * (current.x - previous.x) / (current.y - previous.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">            if (scanPass == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">              if (crossingX &lt; firstX) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">                firstX = crossingX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">                firstCount = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">              } else if (crossingX == firstX) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">                firstCount += 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">              }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">            } else if (crossingX &gt; firstX) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">              secondX = min(secondX, crossingX);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">            }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">          }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">          previous = current;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">    if (scanPass == 1u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">      if (firstCount % 2u == 1u &amp;&amp; secondX &lt; LARGE) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">        return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(0.5 * (firstX + secondX), lineY, 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">// Scores an n x n grid like searchWindow but keeps the best CANDIDATE_COUNT cells, sorted by\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">// signed distance descending (ties keep the earlier cell).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">fn scoreGrid(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">  center: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">  halfSize: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">  gridSize: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">  ringStart: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">  ringEnd: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">  origin: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">  top: ptr&lt;function, array&lt;vec3&lt;f32&gt;, CANDIDATE_COUNT&gt;&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">  let cell = 2.0 * halfSize / f32(gridSize);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">  for (var j = 0u; j &lt; gridSize; j++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">    for (var i = 0u; i &lt; gridSize; i++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">      let p = center - vec2&lt;f32&gt;(halfSize) + cell * (vec2&lt;f32&gt;(f32(i), f32(j)) + vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.5));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"166\">      var entry = vec3&lt;f32&gt;(p, getSignedDistance(p, ringStart, ringEnd, origin));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"167\">      for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; CANDIDATE_COUNT; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"168\">        if (entry.z &gt; (*top)[slot].z) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"169\">          let displaced = (*top)[slot];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"170\">          (*top)[slot] = entry;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"171\">          entry = displaced;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"172\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"173\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"174\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"175\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"176\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"177\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"178\">// Scores an n x n grid of cell centers over [center - halfSize, center + halfSize]^2 and returns\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"179\">// the better of the grid winner and `best` (ties keep the earlier candidate).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"180\">fn searchWindow(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"181\">  center: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"182\">  halfSize: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"183\">  gridSize: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"184\">  ringStart: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"185\">  ringEnd: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"186\">  origin: vec2&lt;f32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"187\">  bestIn: vec3&lt;f32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"188\">) -&gt; vec3&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"189\">  var best = bestIn;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"190\">  let cell = 2.0 * halfSize / f32(gridSize);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"191\">  for (var j = 0u; j &lt; gridSize; j++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"192\">    for (var i = 0u; i &lt; gridSize; i++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"193\">      let p = center - vec2&lt;f32&gt;(halfSize) + cell * (vec2&lt;f32&gt;(f32(i), f32(j)) + vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.5));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"194\">      let distance = getSignedDistance(p, ringStart, ringEnd, origin);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"195\">      if (distance &gt; best.z) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"196\">        best = vec3&lt;f32&gt;(p, distance);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"197\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"198\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"199\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"200\">  return best;\n</span></code></pre><p>299 source lines omitted</p><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions